432	124,867,656,1290	432. Corolla of Catalpa laid open, with the stamens.	The Catalpa corolla slit and spread open: a broad bell with wavy, frilled lobes, its inside streaked and spotted, and two curved stamens standing on the tube.
433	720,967,884,1297	433. Winged seed of Trumpet-Creeper.	A flat seed of the Trumpet-Creeper: a dark kernel in the middle of a broad, thin, papery wing streaked with fine lines.
